@format 1
@id queue.switch-station
@title Switch worklist station
@area Queue
@entry input
@summary Move the console to the previous or next station and refresh progress and controls for that station.
@flow TB

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole

[input] Station navigation requested <input>
- Receive Previous or Next station command @ console.PConsoleStationMove(...)
> switch

[switch] Resolve station <decision>
- Wrap the requested step across the current station board @ console.PConsoleStationMove(...)
? "Only one station exists" > unchanged
? "A different station is resolved" > result

[result] Station switched <output>
- Refresh progress, status, and controls for the new station @ console.PConsoleProgressUpdate(...)
= Console actions now govern the selected station.

[unchanged] Station unchanged <output>
= The current station remains selected.
